<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 239)</h2>
<p><b>The first plugin seam: bring your own tracker.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>The production-tracker integration is now a swappable provider: drop an executable at <code>~/Library/Application Support/Asobi/Plugins/tracker_provider</code> (or the studio pipeline's <code>asobi/plugins/</code>) and Asobi uses it instead of the bundled Kitsu one — review lists, playlists, publish, and the watch-folder oracle all work against it unchanged.</li>
<li>The contract is a page of documented JSON-lines (<code>docs/PLUGINS.md</code> in the repo) and the bundled Kitsu provider is the readable reference implementation — a ShotGrid or Flow provider starts as a copy of it.</li>
<li>A custom provider is never silently in effect: the Kitsu panel names it, in orange.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
